dist/
**/dist-check/  # V2.10.37: electron-builder / electron-vite build output. Source lives in agent-desktop/build/ (build config), not here. ~1 GB of binary artifacts, must not be committed. V2.10.43: **/ matches nested paths (agent-desktop/dist-check/).
out/
