# V2.10: scratch-pad directories (cloned upstream repos used as design
# reference during the V2.6 + V2.7 skills import). They are not part of
# the build, are not referenced from any code, and bloat the working
# tree by ~177 MB. Keep them locally for the team that wants them;
# they MUST NOT be committed. Re-clone from upstream on demand.
.review-extras/
.review-codegraph/

# Top-level repo files (the outer cubecloud-agentic-os/ monorepo).
# .agents/, .github/, apps/, packages/, docs/, scripts/ are tracked.
# The agent-desktop/ subdir is the vendored mirror; its
# governance docs (README, LICENSE, NOTICE, BRANDING, HANDBOOK,
# docs/handbook/, docs/legal/) are Windows-native hardlinks and
# junctions into the outer root, and are NOT tracked as links by
# git \u2014 they are just regular files with the same content. On
# non-Windows clones the sync-docs.ps1 script must re-create them.

